1
00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:59,830
I, Yama, have lived for a thousand years,

2
00:00:59,830 --> 00:01:02,430
yet today I fell
into the hands of a little girl.

3
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:06,620
I'm doomed. I'm so doomed.

4
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:09,600
Did we just kiss?

5
00:01:13,330 --> 00:01:13,930
No.

6
00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:16,100
Is he going to kill me to silence me?

7
00:01:16,860 --> 00:01:18,560
I'll show goodwill first.

8
00:01:18,660 --> 00:01:20,920
He wouldn't kill me while eating, right?

9
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:25,960
Um,

10
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,130
Uncle.

11
00:01:27,730 --> 00:01:28,500
Uncle,

12
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:31,630
I just wanted to give you a chicken leg.

13
00:01:33,229 --> 00:01:34,400
Uncle,

14
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:35,900
you are so handsome.

15
00:01:36,330 --> 00:01:37,130
Uncle,

16
00:01:37,930 --> 00:01:39,000
I like you.

17
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:39,860
Uncle,

18
00:01:40,630 --> 00:01:41,960
I want to marry you.

19
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,360
Let me be your wife, okay?

20
00:01:46,660 --> 00:01:47,590
You called me...

21
00:01:48,660 --> 00:01:49,300
Uncle?

22
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:52,400
Ah.

23
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,660
Tell me, who exactly are you?

24
00:01:58,229 --> 00:02:00,400
Me? Who am I?

25
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,130
Right.

26
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:05,600
Who am I?

27
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:07,960
My mind is completely blank.

28
00:02:08,229 --> 00:02:09,860
I can't remember anything.

29
00:02:10,660 --> 00:02:12,530
I actually cannot read her mind.

30
00:02:14,630 --> 00:02:16,160
Since everything is blank,

31
00:02:16,260 --> 00:02:17,760
I'll call myself Kong.

32
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:20,829
At least this name is

33
00:02:20,829 --> 00:02:22,560
the first thing I chose myself.

34
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:25,560
Kong.

35
00:02:26,230 --> 00:02:27,560
Call me Kong.

36
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,329
You are not her.

37
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,600
Um, Uncle,

38
00:02:47,329 --> 00:02:49,260
I am very sorry about last night.

39
00:02:49,530 --> 00:02:51,329
But that was just a coincidence.

40
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:54,160
Can you spare my life?

41
00:02:58,730 --> 00:02:59,530
Fine.

42
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:02,430
Go keep vigil for Bai for seven days.

43
00:03:02,930 --> 00:03:04,530
After that, I will spare you.

44
00:03:07,430 --> 00:03:08,200
Old monster,

45
00:03:08,300 --> 00:03:09,530
I am not dead yet!

46
00:03:09,530 --> 00:03:10,960
Having someone keep vigil for me,

47
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,420
what are your intentions?

48
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,960
Sister,

49
00:03:24,030 --> 00:03:25,460
you almost crushed me to death.

50
00:03:25,460 --> 00:03:27,660
You have to take responsibility for me.

51
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:30,200
Didn't I hit a fish?

52
00:03:30,260 --> 00:03:31,360
Could it be...

53
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,260
I am that fish?

54
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:38,000
Sister, what is your true form?

55
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,960
You have a very nice scent on you.

56
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:42,460
She is just a mortal.

57
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:45,329
Uncle,

58
00:03:45,530 --> 00:03:46,630
since Bai is fine,

59
00:03:46,630 --> 00:03:48,000
can I leave now?

60
00:03:48,630 --> 00:03:49,960
I will give you a chance.

61
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:51,360
Walk out of this room,

62
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,690
and I will let you leave.

63
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:56,200
Sister,

64
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:58,329
I haven't finished talking to you.

65
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:00,060
Old monster, let me go!

66
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:03,560
Walk out.

67
00:04:03,730 --> 00:04:05,860
Is he insulting my intelligence?

68
00:04:10,700 --> 00:04:11,430
Ouch!

69
00:04:14,660 --> 00:04:16,260
A magic barrier.

70
00:04:16,630 --> 00:04:18,360
I almost forgot they are demons.

71
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:20,490
It seems I need to find another way out.

72
00:04:30,260 --> 00:04:31,660
They are all black.

73
00:04:32,460 --> 00:04:34,460
Does this man have no clothes
of other colors?

74
00:04:34,460 --> 00:04:36,060
No wonder his face is so dark.

75
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,630
Is this face mine?

76
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:52,630
Why can't I even remember
what I look like?

77
00:04:58,530 --> 00:05:00,130
You can do this, Kong.

78
00:05:00,460 --> 00:05:02,590
Stay alive first, then find yourself.

79
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:13,160
Why is there such an exquisite box here?

80
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:17,800
What is inside it?

81
00:05:36,130 --> 00:05:38,330
Sect Leader, that is your spirit stone.

82
00:05:40,530 --> 00:05:42,590
Every demon has its own spirit stone.

83
00:05:42,659 --> 00:05:43,960
The stronger the spiritual power,

84
00:05:43,960 --> 00:05:46,430
the more the stone tends
toward extreme heat or cold.

85
00:05:46,430 --> 00:05:48,860
Most demons hide their spirit stones
within their bodies.

86
00:05:48,860 --> 00:05:49,460
Because

87
00:05:50,230 --> 00:05:52,030
if the stone remains, the demon lives;

88
00:05:52,030 --> 00:05:53,060
if it shatters, the demon dies.
